// Source: https://github.com/SinghAmreek/PowerAutomateTelemetry/blob/main/QueryPackTemplate/template.json (query: "Top 10 Flows by Runs")
// Tenant-wide flow-run leaderboard. Pairs with query 12 (billable actions) to see which flows
// fire often but only do a few actions vs. the opposite.
requests
| where customDimensions['resourceProvider'] == 'Cloud Flow'
| extend cd = parse_json(tostring(customDimensions["Data"]))
| extend flowname = tostring(cd.FlowDisplayName)
| summarize FlowRuns = count() by flowname
| top 10 by FlowRuns desc
| render barchart
